  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Crab-Stuffed Sole",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s stuffed sole recipe jazzes up mild sole fillets with a delicious stuffing made from sweet Dungeness crab and zesty poblano pepper.",
  "authors": [
